<title>UK: Logica to buy Irish network services firm.</title>
<headline>Logica to buy Irish network services firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British software company Logica Plc said on Thursday it agreed to buy Ireland's Aldiscon Ltd for a maximum of 51.0 million stg.</p>
</text>
